      { "type": "text", "html": "<b>Set State:</b> Not used <i>(no logic)</i>" },
      { "type": "text", "html": "<b>Get State:</b> Not used <i>(returns <b>State</b>, initially equal to <code>0</code>)</i>" },
      { "type": "text", "html": "<b>Register layout:</b>" },
      { "type": "table", "align": ["center", "left", "left", "left"], "head": ["Index", "Name", "Data format", "Description"], "rows": [
        ["<code>[0]</code>", "<b>Flags</b>", "<code>MMMMMMMMMMMMMMMM_____319764285SL</code>", "<code>M...M</code> - Central glass material<br><i>Take a look at the Num-pad</i><br><code>3</code> - Visibility of the <b>bottom-right corner</b> of the frame<br><code>1</code> - Visibility of the <b>bottom-left corner</b> of the frame<br><code>9</code> - Visibility of the <b>top-right corner</b> of the frame<br><code>7</code> - Visibility of the <b>top-left corner</b> of the frame<br><code>6</code> - Visibility of the <b>right part</b> of the frame<br><code>4</code> - Visibility of the <b>left part</b> of the frame<br><code>2</code> - Visibility of the <b>bottom part</b> of the frame<br><code>8</code> - Visibility of the <b>top part</b> of the frame<br><code>5</code> - Visibility of the <b>central part</b> <i>(glass)</i><br><code>S</code> - Does it let <b>Solver Gun</b> rays through?<br><code>L</code> - Does it let <b>Laser</b> rays through?"],
        ["<code>[1]</code>", "<b>Size</b>", "<code>XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYY</code>", "<code>X...X</code> - Frame length<br><code>Y...Y</code> - Frame height"],
